  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RESTORATION &amp; ENHANCEMENT OF FRESHWATER WETLANDS ON COASTAL PLAIN OF TAMAULIPAS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will: 1) Restore 4,670 acres of freshwater wetlands adjacent to the Laguna Madre within the Rancho El Mezquite, through construction of hydraulic infrastructure; and, 2) protect those acres through a 20 year conservation agreement with the ranch owner to promote conservation and better management in the Rancho El Mezquite.</narrative>
  </description>
